(6184048, 913014, 96751, '<td valign="top">If this is not an art installation at a museum, it must be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a>.  Or someone as seriously demented and brilliant...  Simply outstanding in every single way. The concept and execution, the marvelous texture on the ground and the lighting behind the moon; the way the branches seem to sway in an unseen wind.  A 10 from me and my prediction for the blue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-13 00:17:11.</i></td>', 'If this is not an art installation at a museum, it must be  gyaban.  Or someone as seriously demented and brilliant...  Simply outstanding in every single way. The concept and execution, the marvelous texture on the ground and the lighting behind the moon; the way the branches seem to sway in an unseen wind.  A 10 from me and my prediction for the blue.', '2010-10-06 22:31:56.000000', '2010-10-13 01:17:11.000000', 1),
