(6185421, 913070, 85430, '<td valign="top">very nice colors. the subject was perfectly isolated from the background. excellent shot.</td>', 'very nice colors. the subject was perfectly isolated from the background. excellent shot.', '2010-10-07 22:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185434, 912966, 85430, '<td valign="top">very good take on the challenge. i like the colors and the perfect balance between light and shadows. the dof is absolutely great.</td>', 'very good take on the challenge. i like the colors and the perfect balance between light and shadows. the dof is absolutely great.', '2010-10-07 22:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185445, 913015, 85430, '<td valign="top">very nice take on the challenge. i like the rendering of light and shadows. overall a very good image.</td>', 'very nice take on the challenge. i like the rendering of light and shadows. overall a very good image.', '2010-10-07 22:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185450, 913060, 85430, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge. but the choice of subject and the angle from which the shot was taken wasn''t a very good one.</td>', 'meets the challenge. but the choice of subject and the angle from which the shot was taken wasn''t a very good one.', '2010-10-07 22:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185474, 912874, 85430, '<td valign="top">great impact indeed. the lighting on the subject was just right and the good use of dof make it stand out. but i find the background very dark and the upper half gives a lot of negative space. overall this is a very nice image</td>', 'great impact indeed. the lighting on the subject was just right and the good use of dof make it stand out. but i find the background very dark and the upper half gives a lot of negative space. overall this is a very nice image', '2010-10-07 23:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185486, 912892, 85430, '<td valign="top">good take on the challenge. but i find the lighting a bit flat.</td>', 'good take on the challenge. but i find the lighting a bit flat.', '2010-10-07 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185493, 912526, 85430, '<td valign="top">nice play with shadows.</td>', 'nice play with shadows.', '2010-10-07 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185502, 912858, 85430, '<td valign="top">good play with lights and shadow. nice choice of subject.</td>', 'good play with lights and shadow. nice choice of subject.', '2010-10-07 23:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185576, 912885, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on a simple forks photo. The duo-tone effect really adds something to the photo.</td>', 'Interesting take on a simple forks photo. The duo-tone effect really adds something to the photo.', '2010-10-07 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185577, 913143, 114225, '<td valign="top">Took me a bit to figure out what this was, but once I did, I liked the photo even more. Very nice job making this interesting by angling the view and using DOF to give more depth to the photo.</td>', 'Took me a bit to figure out what this was, but once I did, I liked the photo even more. Very nice job making this interesting by angling the view and using DOF to give more depth to the photo.', '2010-10-07 23:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185578, 912899, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great entry for this challenge. My one big critique of this is the blown highlight object in the front. That piece is distracting, but the rest is done well.</td>', 'Great entry for this challenge. My one big critique of this is the blown highlight object in the front. That piece is distracting, but the rest is done well.', '2010-10-07 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185581, 912474, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun and cool take on this challenge. I am finding myself not liking the white in this photo, I think it detracts from the old look of the sword somehow.</td>', 'Fun and cool take on this challenge. I am finding myself not liking the white in this photo, I think it detracts from the old look of the sword somehow.', '2010-10-07 23:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185582, 912431, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good soft lighting used in this photo. I like the tight crop and the amount of detail shown as well.</td>', 'Good soft lighting used in this photo. I like the tight crop and the amount of detail shown as well.', '2010-10-07 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185585, 912571, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge. Nice job picking bright and shiny props, although this photo as a whole doesn''t hold a lot of interest for me.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge. Nice job picking bright and shiny props, although this photo as a whole doesn''t hold a lot of interest for me.', '2010-10-07 23:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185590, 912888, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job using side lighting to add mood to what would likely have been a much more boring photo.</td>', 'Great job using side lighting to add mood to what would likely have been a much more boring photo.', '2010-10-07 23:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185593, 913106, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see the details in the brushed metal, and the lighting is very nice. I guess I''m not super interested in the photo overall, mainly because I don''t get the significance of the logo.</td>', 'I like how you can see the details in the brushed metal, and the lighting is very nice. I guess I''m not super interested in the photo overall, mainly because I don''t get the significance of the logo.', '2010-10-07 23:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185595, 913070, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge. Good job with the soft lighting and the high details.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge. Good job with the soft lighting and the high details.', '2010-10-07 23:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185596, 912979, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would do a welding shot. You capture this quite nicely.</td>', 'I was hoping someone would do a welding shot. You capture this quite nicely.', '2010-10-07 23:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185599, 913060, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny idea with the title, but not a lot of interest in this shot. I think the way it setup/lit just doesn''t show any story.</td>', 'Funny idea with the title, but not a lot of interest in this shot. I think the way it setup/lit just doesn''t show any story.', '2010-10-07 23:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185600, 912966, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great color cast and mood to this photo. I really like the shallow depth of field you chose for this photo.</td>', 'Great color cast and mood to this photo. I really like the shallow depth of field you chose for this photo.', '2010-10-07 23:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6185603, 912875, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute play on works. Nice use of close crop and shallow depth of field. Other than that, I just don''t find a lot of interest in this shot.</td>', 'Cute play on works. Nice use of close crop and shallow depth of field. Other than that, I just don''t find a lot of interest in this shot.', '2010-10-07 23:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
