(6187258, 912900, 109740, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this photo!  It meets the topic of the challenge, it is the focus of the photo, but the background/surroundings are also beautiful.  The fact that it is not posed makes this picture even better.  GREAT job!  You have an eye for the interesting photo...</td>', 'I REALLY like this photo!  It meets the topic of the challenge, it is the focus of the photo, but the background/surroundings are also beautiful.  The fact that it is not posed makes this picture even better.  GREAT job!  You have an eye for the interesting photo...', '2010-10-09 19:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6187259, 913032, 109740, '<td valign="top">the macro feature of this photo pulls it up from the lack of subject, and the angle it is taken from gives the picture good perspective...  keep working on your skills by finding a better subject next time...</td>', 'the macro feature of this photo pulls it up from the lack of subject, and the angle it is taken from gives the picture good perspective...  keep working on your skills by finding a better subject next time...', '2010-10-09 19:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
