(6189113, 913129, 121916, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors in this.  I think the background is too busy and would have been better shown just against the red.</td>', 'I like the bright colors in this.  I think the background is too busy and would have been better shown just against the red.', '2010-10-12 08:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189328, 913066, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the story you have created here.  Refreshing.</td>', 'I love the story you have created here.  Refreshing.', '2010-10-12 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189330, 913094, 47470, '<td valign="top">Looks like your shadow in the foreground.  Photog shadows rank right up there with reflections of the camera as a no-no in an image.</td>', 'Looks like your shadow in the foreground.  Photog shadows rank right up there with reflections of the camera as a no-no in an image.', '2010-10-12 12:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189335, 913008, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the light on the background, but I''m not so sure I like the reflections in the bowls of the spoons.  I wish they were a bit cleaner to fit the calm, smooth, "honey"-esque mood of the image.  And now that I''ve noticed that the spoons are different, I wish they had been pairs.  You did a great job creating a tangible emotion with the color in this image though.</td>', 'I love the light on the background, but I''m not so sure I like the reflections in the bowls of the spoons.  I wish they were a bit cleaner to fit the calm, smooth, "honey"-esque mood of the image.  And now that I''ve noticed that the spoons are different, I wish they had been pairs.  You did a great job creating a tangible emotion with the color in this image though.', '2010-10-12 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189336, 913135, 62989, '<td valign="top">this is a good idea and the upper torso works just great but the lower section not soo good - more contrast or a tighter crop ?</td>', 'this is a good idea and the upper torso works just great but the lower section not soo good - more contrast or a tighter crop ?', '2010-10-12 12:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189338, 913069, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had moved the tape on the back two so it wouldn''t be visible.  I''m on the fence about the colors; I seem to relate them with technology from the 90s (though I guess CDs did get popular in the late 90s), which makes the image seem dated to me.  I do particularly like the detail in the multiple shadows though.</td>', 'I wish you had moved the tape on the back two so it wouldn''t be visible.  I''m on the fence about the colors; I seem to relate them with technology from the 90s (though I guess CDs did get popular in the late 90s), which makes the image seem dated to me.  I do particularly like the detail in the multiple shadows though.', '2010-10-12 12:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189341, 912990, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think the composition could have been better, especially if you were the one setting up the shot.  The objects look like they are simply sitting next to one another, but in a great still life, they would also look like they were relating to one another to tell a story.  The lighting is also a bit too flat to help give definition and emotion to the image.</td>', 'I think the composition could have been better, especially if you were the one setting up the shot.  The objects look like they are simply sitting next to one another, but in a great still life, they would also look like they were relating to one another to tell a story.  The lighting is also a bit too flat to help give definition and emotion to the image.', '2010-10-12 12:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189349, 913131, 47470, '<td valign="top">This could be a cool image, but I think the lighting lets the shot down.  It''s too direct, too harsh, and too flat.  I would have moved the main light far camera left, almost pointing directly down the blade (I would have made this light much softer/diffused too).  Then I would have added a relatively harsh (but still not bare bulb) light behind and camera left of the subject, slightly higher than the subject, to add a rim light.</td>', 'This could be a cool image, but I think the lighting lets the shot down.  It''s too direct, too harsh, and too flat.  I would have moved the main light far camera left, almost pointing directly down the blade (I would have made this light much softer/diffused too).  Then I would have added a relatively harsh (but still not bare bulb) light behind and camera left of the subject, slightly higher than the subject, to add a rim light.', '2010-10-12 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189354, 912692, 62989, '<td valign="top">the strong light and overblown highlights will cost you a lot - but i think they look wistful - like a memory of a horse 7</td>', 'the strong light and overblown highlights will cost you a lot - but i think they look wistful - like a memory of a horse 7', '2010-10-12 12:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189355, 913054, 62989, '<td valign="top">one of the few entries with a genuine feel of metal on other metal 8</td>', 'one of the few entries with a genuine feel of metal on other metal 8', '2010-10-12 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189356, 912858, 62989, '<td valign="top">nice image - got a classic feel to it 8</td>', 'nice image - got a classic feel to it 8', '2010-10-12 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189358, 912431, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot as far as pictures of money go.  The lighting does a great job of emphasizing the detail on the coins.  This would do well as stock.  I still can''t help but wish that there was something more to add a little interest.</td>', 'This is a nice shot as far as pictures of money go.  The lighting does a great job of emphasizing the detail on the coins.  This would do well as stock.  I still can''t help but wish that there was something more to add a little interest.', '2010-10-12 12:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189366, 913015, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the geometry in this.  It definitely stands out from the million other fork images on this site.  The light give this an almost religious feel, and I mean that in a positive way.  Eating *could* be a religious experience when the food is prepared properly!  One nit-pick: I wish the horizontal had been straightened.</td>', 'I love the geometry in this.  It definitely stands out from the million other fork images on this site.  The light give this an almost religious feel, and I mean that in a positive way.  Eating *could* be a religious experience when the food is prepared properly!  One nit-pick: I wish the horizontal had been straightened.', '2010-10-12 13:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6189372, 913022, 62989, '<td valign="top">utterly baffling</td>', 'utterly baffling', '2010-10-12 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
