(6189757, 913014, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very unique entry! Great effort in setting it up and the lighting''s fantastic. Even the caption''s perfect for it. No doubt in my mind - this will get the blue.<br/> <br/>I can see the support thread for the moon - too bad it''s basic editing.</td>', 'Very unique entry! Great effort in setting it up and the lighting''s fantastic. Even the caption''s perfect for it. No doubt in my mind - this will get the blue. I can see the support thread for the moon - too bad it''s basic editing.', '2010-10-12 21:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
