(6191300, 912495, 54844, '<td valign="top">Well, at least I finished ahead of the Yellow Chair!  I thought this would do better, but to some, it may be a little obscure.  Thanks for the comments, and yes, this is all natural colors, and with a piece of raw iron such as this, and the wrench, there is and will be some blue tints to it.  The solder splatter comes across as chrome.  I did use a flash bounced off of a gold reflector.  OH...and thanks for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-13 23:27:36.</i></td>', 'Well, at least I finished ahead of the Yellow Chair!  I thought this would do better, but to some, it may be a little obscure.  Thanks for the comments, and yes, this is all natural colors, and with a piece of raw iron such as this, and the wrench, there is and will be some blue tints to it.  The solder splatter comes across as chrome.  I did use a flash bounced off of a gold reflector.  OH...and thanks for the comments.', '2010-10-14 00:17:00.000000', '2010-10-14 00:27:36.000000', 0),
(6191436, 913135, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is actually quite cool! Very interesting image. :)</td>', 'This is actually quite cool! Very interesting image. :)', '2010-10-14 08:00:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6191564, 913070, 30861, '<td valign="top">For THIS challenge, not a bad finish at all, when you consider that, arguably, the image isn''t a real strong example of "metal on metal"; If you were to ask me to fill in the blanks and title this "Metal on ____", I''d probably use the word "grass" :-)<br/> <br/>It''s a good, clean, well-made image. Keep up the high technicals and when you click with an image that resonates with voters AND the topic, you''ll have a winner :-)</td>', 'For THIS challenge, not a bad finish at all, when you consider that, arguably, the image isn''t a real strong example of "metal on metal"; If you were to ask me to fill in the blanks and title this "Metal on ____", I''d probably use the word "grass" :-) It''s a good, clean, well-made image. Keep up the high technicals and when you click with an image that resonates with voters AND the topic, you''ll have a winner :-)', '2010-10-14 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6191572, 913070, 121949, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> My score really didn''t bother me that much, I think technically it is a sound picture, but your right about it being not a great example of metal on metal. The five 1''s are what bother me the most, I only give a 1 if the picture is both off subject and poor quality.</td>', ' Bear_Music My score really didn''t bother me that much, I think technically it is a sound picture, but your right about it being not a great example of metal on metal. The five 1''s are what bother me the most, I only give a 1 if the picture is both off subject and poor quality.', '2010-10-14 11:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
