(6191802, 913070, 12076, '<td valign="top">I generally fish with dries, or nymphs, but the wet flies are the most beautiful.  Your husband does a fine job.  The photo is good too! Five ones??  Don''t let it bother you.  Just consider it a comment on the voters and not the image.  :-)</td>', 'I generally fish with dries, or nymphs, but the wet flies are the most beautiful.  Your husband does a fine job.  The photo is good too! Five ones??  Don''t let it bother you.  Just consider it a comment on the voters and not the image.  :-)', '2010-10-14 17:27:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6191847, 913070, 121949, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=12076" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tph1</a>This one was just for show. He usually ties dry flies and nymphs too, but they aren''t all that fun to look at.</td>', ' tph1This one was just for show. He usually ties dry flies and nymphs too, but they aren''t all that fun to look at.', '2010-10-14 18:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
