(6200442, 912965, 117534, '<td valign="top">Sitting here Watching my Dreams score turn into a nightmare, I like to look at your photo''s... First chance I''ve had to go snooping since this challenge, A)I Loved this. B) knowing now that you did it on a LAPTOP, OMG I love it even more!!! ( I like old and rusty, it fits me ) LOL  Seriously Great job!!! Katie</td>', 'Sitting here Watching my Dreams score turn into a nightmare, I like to look at your photo''s... First chance I''ve had to go snooping since this challenge, A)I Loved this. B) knowing now that you did it on a LAPTOP, OMG I love it even more!!! ( I like old and rusty, it fits me ) LOL  Seriously Great job!!! Katie', '2010-10-25 02:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6212427, 912334, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Andrew Wyeth of the desert?  I feel the scraps of of screening keening, the low sun mirroring the distortions of the old glass as it describes the texture of the tin. (Perfect lighting; I shudder to think what hdr might do to this).</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Andrew Wyeth of the desert?  I feel the scraps of of screening keening, the low sun mirroring the distortions of the old glass as it describes the texture of the tin. (Perfect lighting; I shudder to think what hdr might do to this).', '2010-11-05 00:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
